        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.15.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mwandzo 15:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zino baraka zohadzwa ni Daudi, zinahusu ariotiywa tsatsani bahi, yani Ayahudi, hebu hata atu asio kala Ayahudi piya? Nakutambukizani Maandiko gaambago kukala Burahimu wahendwa kukala ana haki kpwa kukuluphira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi nakumanyisani kukala, Burahimu ariphohendwa kukala wa haki kala kadzangbwetiywa tsatsani. Ela bada ya higa ndipho achitiywa tsatsani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.17.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mwandzo 17:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsatsa kala ni dalili ya kuonyesa kukala Mlungu wamkubali Burahimu kukala ana haki, hata kabila kadzangbwetiywa tsatsani. Mana Mlungu wamuhenda kukala ana haki kpwa sababu ya kumkuluphira tu, wala si kpwa sababu ya kutiywa tsatsani. Kpwa hivyo Burahimu ndiye mkare wa chiroho wa atu osi amukuluphirao Mlungu na kukubaliwa kukala ana haki bila ya kutiywa tsatsani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu ariotiywa tsatsani nao, Burahimu ni mkare wao wa chiroho vivyo, achimkuluphira Mlungu. Mana kakala ise yao kpwa sababu atiywa tsatsani, ela ni ise yao kpwa sababu amkuluphira Mlungu dza viratu ye mwenye, hata kabila kadzangbwetiywa tsatsani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
