            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.22.17+GEN.22.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22:17–18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.3.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Agalatia 3:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu wamlaga Burahimu na vivyazivye kuapha dunia ndzima ikale yao. Mlungu kaikire chilagane hichi na Burahimu kpwa sababu kala analunga Shariya, ela ni kpwa sababu Burahimu kala anamkuluphira, ndipho naye Mlungu achimkubali kala ana haki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.3.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Agalatia 3:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana ichikala atu alungao Shariya ndio ndiophokera cho chilagane, phahi kumkuluphira Mlungu kungekala ni kazi ya bure. Piya chilagane cha Mlungu chingekala ni cha handzo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mana mutu avundzaye Shariya nkutiywa adabu. Ela ichikala takuna Shariya, phahi takuna mutu wa kutiywa adabu kpwa sababu ya kura kuvundza Shariya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
