              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela gaandikpwa kpwa sababu yehu piya. Ganahuhakikishira kukala huchimkuluphira Mlungu, ariyemfufula Bwana wehu Jesu, swiswi naswi hundahendwa kukala na haki. ",
